{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i>Cairns</i>?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cairns</i> is the exemplary stone balancing simulation game. Travel to diverse and breathtaking outdoor environments, where each Cairn Stack is a self contained physics puzzle requiring Balance, Patience and Perfection to solve and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d51e71de82b6960e309b2f888e8dcc2e.poster.avif?t=1759340179\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d51e71de82b6960e309b2f888e8dcc2e.webm?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d51e71de82b6960e309b2f888e8dcc2e.mp4?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring over 100 hand-crafted puzzling Stacks to solve and complete, across 5 glorious outdoor environments, <i>Cairns</i> has a significant amount to play, learn and master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself into the ancient practice of building Cairns, in an environmentally safe and non-destructive way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rewarding satisfaction of balancing the physics simulated stones in a freestanding Stack to reach the target height, unlocking greater challenges and new environments.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on achievement through intuitive controls and improved quality of life features like Undo / Redo and Pinning Stones in place.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immortalize and share your success of perfection with Photo mode, or just take in the glory of nature with full Environment Controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The foundation of achieving success in <i>Cairns</i> is achieving Balance. Maintaining the placement of each stone, their order, and the center of gravity is necessary to complete each Cairn Stack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/45892a631a66a8b88d238752694815d4.poster.avif?t=1759340179\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/45892a631a66a8b88d238752694815d4.webm?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/45892a631a66a8b88d238752694815d4.mp4?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurately simulated real time physics makes balancing stones intuitive, and every Cairn Stack has been carefully designed to be challenging yet achievable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Patience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience is necessary to overcome the hurdles and frustrations of failure, and push through to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emphasis on designing a high quality of life experience is at the heart of <i>Cairns</i>, making mistakes educational rather than painful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d55b14979519477fecee3867c38e15fa.poster.avif?t=1759340179\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d55b14979519477fecee3867c38e15fa.webm?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d55b14979519477fecee3867c38e15fa.mp4?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes <i>Cairns</i> pleasant and flowing are features like</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive camera and Stone controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo and Redo </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinning Stones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode and Environment Controls\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striving for Perfection, and achieving it, is the most satisfying measure of ability. It is not enough to simply reach a Stack's goal height. Challenge yourself to go above and beyond, perhaps using every stone, or the least amount of stones, as quickly as possible, or with as few moves as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/cfcd6574029f4547301b128062f62a80.poster.avif?t=1759340179\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/cfcd6574029f4547301b128062f62a80.webm?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/cfcd6574029f4547301b128062f62a80.mp4?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow things down and focus. <i>Cairns</i> is the perfect<i>\u00a0</i>game to lose yourself in, and promises a calm, mindful, challenging and rewarding experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810840?t=1759340179","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.