frustrations of failure, and push through to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emphasis on designing a high quality of life experience is at the heart of <i>Cairns</i>, making mistakes educational rather than painful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d55b14979519477fecee3867c38e15fa.poster.avif?t=1759340179\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d55b14979519477fecee3867c38e15fa.webm?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/d55b14979519477fecee3867c38e15fa.mp4?t=1759340179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes <i>Cairns</i> pleasant and flowing are features like</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive camera and Stone controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo and Redo </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinning Stones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo Mode and Environment Controls\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striving for Perfection, and achieving it, is the most satisfying measure of ability. It is not enough to simply reach a Stack's goal height. Challenge yourself to go above and beyond, perhaps using every stone, or the least amount of stones, as quickly as possible, or with as few moves as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810840/extras/cfcd6574029f4547301b128062f62a80.poster.avif?t=1759340179\" width=640 height=360 ><sou